# OxSteam AfterReactor Gas Fractionation System
### Downstream Molecular Separation Array & Contaminant Mitigation

The AfterReactor processes the hot, unpressurized, upward-flowing syngas effluent exiting the Inverted-Y clean upper port. Because gravity has precipitated 100% of macroscopic oxides downward, this clean stream is systematically stripped of high-value gases using sequential subnanometer molecular sieves.

